@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

title MED-06 - CLASS DIAGRAM: ALLOCATION STRATEGY

class AllocationService <<service>> {
  + allocateImmediate(registrationId): void
  + runAllocation(sessionId, organizerId): AllocationRun
}

interface TicketAllocationStrategy <<strategy>> {
  + allocate(session, candidates, confirmedCount): AllocationPlan
}

class FcfsAllocationStrategy <<strategy>> {
  + allocate(session, candidates, confirmedCount): AllocationPlan
}

class LotteryAllocationStrategy <<strategy>> {
  + allocate(session, candidates, confirmedCount): AllocationPlan
}

class AllocationPlan <<value object>> {
  + confirmedRegistrationIds: UUID[]
  + waitlistedRegistrationIds: UUID[]
  + orderedCandidateIds: UUID[]
}

class EventSession <<entity>> {
  + capacity: int
  + allocationPolicy: AllocationPolicy
}

class Registration <<entity>> {
  + registeredAt: DateTime
  + status: RegistrationStatus
}

AllocationService --> TicketAllocationStrategy : depends on abstraction
TicketAllocationStrategy <|.. FcfsAllocationStrategy
TicketAllocationStrategy <|.. LotteryAllocationStrategy
TicketAllocationStrategy ..> EventSession
TicketAllocationStrategy ..> Registration
TicketAllocationStrategy --> AllocationPlan : returns

note bottom of FcfsAllocationStrategy
FCFS: ưu tiên registeredAt,
tie-breaker xác định.
end note

note bottom of LotteryAllocationStrategy
LOTTERY: tạo thứ tự ngẫu nhiên
sau khi đóng đăng ký.
end note

note right of AllocationService
Service chọn strategy theo AllocationPolicy.
Strategy chỉ tính AllocationPlan,
không tự ghi DB.
end note

@enduml
